        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, production US, at evaporation plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, production US, at evaporation plant
The process is normalized on the gaseous form of gas.;
85bbcf4e-2def-327c-abef-dc1713749acb
This dataset describes the gasification of American natural gas in a European evaporation plant.
Location:  Global data for energy requirements combined with country-specific natural gas characteristics.
Technology: European technology average.
Time period: Data on energy use for the liquefaction stems of a review of common technologies from 2017 and 2019.
Production volume: none
Sampling: Literature.
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_85bbcf4e-2def-327c-abef-dc1713749acb.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
